recommend keep-going the clean Monocypher one-shot primitives are now spent; the next Rye-first crux is either a new primitive (raw XChaCha20 via the DJB ChaCha variant, or Elligator2) or the docs-compression molt that feeds the seed — the latter is higher-Lindy and gate-free
